    "title": "GPS Dumpster Sting Gets Jennings County Sheriff Indicted In Campaign Sign Scandal - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kimberly Clark ,\n1 days ago Jennings County Sheriff William K. \"Kenny\" Freeman Jr. is now facing criminal charges after what sounds like a low-budget political caper: investigators say multiple campaign signs, including one for his challenger, turned up in a dumpster on his property. A grand jury indicted him last Thursday, and state troopers say they got there with the help of a GPS tracker hidden inside one of the missing signs. Read full article\n6",
